This is a message confirming your reservation for room {{ $('availability_switch1').item.json.room_number }}
from {{ DateTime.fromISO($json.startDateTime).toFormat("MMMM d, yyyy 'at' h:mm a") }}
to {{ DateTime.fromISO($json.endDateTime).toFormat("MMMM d, yyyy 'at' h:mm a") }}.

Your confirmation number is {{ $json.id }}.

We look forward to your stay with us!

